# Devon (WorkPortal) -- H17.1/H18.1: keep Docker build contexts small and reproducible. Applies to
# every Dockerfile in this repo (root-context builds for apps/api, apps/web, apps/api/Dockerfile.worker).
# Secrets are never in the repo (H1.1) so there is nothing to exclude on that account; this file is
# purely about build-context size and cache-hit rate.

.git
.claude
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.turbo
**/coverage
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
**/.data
backups
docs
agentic/ledger
e2e/screenshots
*.log
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
